ted skill; no Assassin option is printed. || MONEY: 1D4x100 credits stored (the text layer prints !D4xlOO); the 1D4x100 credits of tradeable goods is in GM Notes. || EQUIPMENT not stored as rows: one weapon for each W.P.; a first-aid kit with extra bandages and antiseptic, a bedroll, a belt, boots, a notepad and personal items have no catalog row. The armor line is three open ranges; only the two homemade suits are offered as rows. The silver dagger maps to knife-silver-plated, the silver cross to small-silver-cross, tinted goggles to goggles, the lighter to cigarette-lighter-refillable, cloak or cape to hooded-cloak. || NOT STORED: the vehicle or riding animal, the Megasteed and Megahorse line, Secret Resources and the note on War Camp hostility are prose in restrictions and GM Notes. The demographic percentages (62% Russian, 6% Ukrainian, 4% Polish, 4% mixed, 4% other) are not stored."
